This source distribution contains the STUN server and Endpoint subset of
SovKit's libnet component, which carries the MIT License retained in LICENSE.
The export inventory and source hashes are recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.md and
docs/export-manifest.json. No full SovKit SDK, client, business data, deployment
records, or original repository history is included.

libuv is an external build dependency. It is not vendored in this source tree.
When redistributing a binary that includes libuv, ship the copyright and license
notices supplied with the exact libuv build, including its bundled components.
This repository's LICENSE alone does not cover those components.
Reviewed libuv 1.52.1 redistribution notices are retained separately in
packaging/licenses/libuv-1.52.1.txt, including LICENSE-extra, ISC and BSD notices.
